  "title": "Ask HN: How do you handle client glossaries as a translator?",
  "url": null,
  "text": "<p>I&#x27;m tired of keeping glossaries in a spreadsheet &amp; emailing them around.<p>Is there a tool that does this?",
  "points": 64,
  "parent_id": null,
  "story_id": 45100002,
  "children": [
    {
