      "created_at": "2026-09-29T07:40:00.000Z",
      "created_at_i": 1790667600,
      "type": "comment",
      "author": "quiet",
      "text": "<p>Our agency keeps one glossary per client in a shared drive folder, and every translator has a slightly different copy of it.</p>",
